{#-
  Compact board: every line is at most 13 fullwidth characters (26 units).

  Row layout, 9 characters wide:
      8 squares (one glyph each) + 1 fullwidth space + 1 fullwidth rank digit

  File letters are printed once above and once below the ranks, 8 wide, which
  keeps every line inside the limit. Only the two-unit characters are used:
  the chess pieces, the fullwidth letters/digits, U+3000 and the black square.
-#}
{% for row in rows -%}
{{ row.cells | map(attribute='glyph') | join }}{{ space }}{{ row.rank }}
{% endfor -%}
{{ files | join }}
